menu "NB1 Gauge"

    config NB1_SIM_DATA
        bool "Drive channels with synthetic data (bench, no ECU)"
        default y
        help
            Runs a task that sweeps RPM and friends so the UI can be exercised
            without a CAN bus. Turn off once a MegaSquirt or the bench
            simulator is connected; otherwise both sources fight.

    config NB1_ENCODER
        bool "Rotary encoder on GPIO18/17/16 (rev B carrier)"
        default n
        help
            Rev C carriers have no encoder: GPIO17/18 are the analog sensor
            inputs and the knob driver's pull-ups would load them. Touch
            covers everything the knob did.

    config NB1_CAN_LISTEN_ONLY
        bool "CAN listen-only (never ACK frames)"
        default n
        help
            Safe when sniffing a bus with other listeners. On the private
            two-node gauge/ECU bus this must be OFF, or the MS2 sees no ACK
            and goes error-passive.

endmenu
